       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ambient Occlusion (On, Off)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chromatic Aberration (On, Off)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Adjustments to “Adventure” difficulty mode",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Yellow highlights on story-progressing dialogue options removed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "The prompt encouraging players to click on the phone has also been removed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fixes for major bugs",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fix of some softlocks due to phone calls",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for inconsistent or incorrectly ordered dialogue lines",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for settings not saving properly (audio options)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Improvements to certain animations and facial expressions",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Kate’s neck movement when starting animations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Eye expressions for Kate (more expressive)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Door-opening animation removed to avoid Kate spinning in place",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved lip sync for some characters",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for Kate’s feet clipping into the ground",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Music and sound effects, including",
